        "original_id": "ff53f340-3c4a-5727-8854-21f6e9783b67",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: HeroClix, Attacktix, Street Fighter\n- Companies: Capcom\n- Systems: Clix system\n- Concepts: collectible miniatures games, fighting video game franchises, superhero comic book universes\n\nFacts:\n- Street Fighter is a fighting video game franchise developed and published by Capcom.\n- HeroClix is a collectible miniatures game that uses the Clix system and centers on superhero comic book worlds, especially the Marvel and DC Comics universes.\n- HeroClix lets players build teams of heroes, villains, or characters from video game series such as Street Fighter, Gears of War, and Halo for turn-based battles on grid maps.\n- Attacktix has been compared to the miniatures game HeroClix.",
